title Full Project Discovery Flow

participant "Client" as Client
participant "DiscoveryPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "ArchitectureDetector" as Detector
participant "Cluster Detection" as Cluster
participant "ContractRegistry" as Contracts
participant "Output Generator" as Output

Client->Pipeline: executeDiscovery(projectRoot, parameters)
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Pipeline: Extract parameters (useLlm, llmThreshold, llmMode)

note right of Pipeline: Step 1: Architecture Detection\nwith Cluster Detection

Pipeline->Detector: detectStack()
activate Detector

Detector->Detector: Discover modules (Gradle/Maven)
Detector->Detector: Analyze each module for:\n  - Primary language\n  - Frameworks\n  - Platforms

note right of Detector: Module detection:\n- settings.gradle.kts\n- pom.xml\n- Directory structure

Detector->Detector: Aggregate technology stack
Detector->Detector: Determine primary language
Detector->Detector: Collect secondary languages
Detector->Detector: Aggregate frameworks (distinct)
Detector->Detector: Aggregate platforms (distinct)
Detector->Detector: Detect architecture patterns
Detector->Detector: Build entry point patterns
Detector->Detector: Calculate overall confidence

Detector-->Pipeline: TechnologyStack(\n  primaryLanguage,\n  secondaryLanguages,\n  frameworks,\n  platforms,\n  patterns,\n  modules,\n  entryPointPatterns,\n  confidence\n)
deactivate Detector

Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate architecture-detection.yaml

note right of Pipeline: Step 2: Cluster Detection

Pipeline->Cluster: detectBuildModules()
activate Cluster
Cluster->Cluster: Check settings.gradle.kts
Cluster->Cluster: Check pom.xml

alt Build modules found
    Cluster-->Pipeline: buildModules list
    note right of Cluster: Gradle modules:\n- i2vision-discover\n- i2vision-instant\n- i2vision-mcp
else No build modules
    Cluster->Cluster: Scan directory structure
    Cluster->Cluster: Detect source directories
    Cluster->Cluster: Count source files
    Cluster-->Pipeline: clusters from directory structure
end
deactivate Cluster

note right of Pipeline: Step 3: Discovery Pipeline Execution

loop For each cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Select cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Load cluster configuration
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Execute discovery phases
    Pipeline->Contracts: Generate contracts
    Contracts-->Pipeline: Contract artifacts
end

Pipeline->Contracts: ContractRegistry(registry)
Contracts-->Pipeline: Registered contracts

note right of Pipeline: Step 4: Output Generation

Pipeline->Output: Generate output files
activate Output
Output->Output: architecture-detection.yaml
Output->Output: cluster-*.yaml
Output->Output: contracts.yaml
Output->Output: semantic-cache/
Output-->Pipeline: Output files
deactivate Output

Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate DiscoveryResult
Pipeline-->Client: DiscoveryResult.success()

deactivate Pipeline
